  <arrangement id="e0b98a22870c1c73a97ba13c6e1f85d5">
    <head>Arrangement</head>
<p>Arranged in two series --
Series 1: Embarcadero Center
Series 2: Rockefeller Center</p>  </arrangement>
  <scopecontent id="8b6c92075d7c5234d953b6df9c65b784">
    <head>Scope and Contents</head>
<p>Peter W. Herman was a partner in the law firm of Milbank LLP, and he was deeply involved in the representation of the Rockefeller family in real estate matters. Most notably, he represented David Rockefeller and his family in their numerous real estate investment and development projects including Rockefeller Center in New York City and as a principal lawyer in the development and financing of Embarcadero Center in San Francisco, California.</p><p>Records include documentation of partnership and limited partnership agreements, intellectual property, acquisitions and sales, closing documents, and associated financing and restructuring materials.</p>  </scopecontent>
  <acqinfo id="0a6b2dba486e3dffe59e5d289b20bb30">
    <head>Immediate Source of Acquisition</head>
<p>The Peter W. Herman papers were donated to RAC by the Herman family in 2023.</p>  </acqinfo>
